तथाभाविन्
तथाभाविन् der so sein wird.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

