तद्
त॑द् (= Pron. -St. त˚ —, u. Nom. Acc. Sg.<BR>n. von dems.) da(hin), dor(hin);<BR> damals,<BR>dann, darum, deshalb, also, nun, und,<BR>so (im Nachs.). Oft correl. zu यद्, येन,<BR>यतस्, यदि o. चेद्। तदपि sogar,<BR>तद्यथा so zum Beispeil.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनन्तर
तदनन्तर unmittelbar verbunden mit (Gen.);<BR>n. adv. (unmittelbar) darauf, alsdann.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदनु
तदनु Adv. darauf, alsdann.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

