तदन्तर्भूत darunter befindlich.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदपस्
त॑दपस् dies Werk habend, an d. W. gewöhnt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

