तदाश्रय
तदाश्रय auf diesen (e, es) bezüglich.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदीय
तदीय diesem (er, en) gehörig;<BR> sein, ihr;<BR>ein solcher.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदुपकारिन्
तदुपकारिन् dazu verhelfend, förderlich.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदुपहित
तदुपहित dadurch bedingt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=145-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

तदून
