यथेच्छ wunschentsprechend;<BR> ˚—, n. u.<BR>˚च्छया adv. nach Wunsch o. Belieben.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यथेप्सित|यथेप्सितं
