यद्
यद्॑ = Pron.-St. य (˚—), u. Nom. Acc. Sgl.<BR>von dems., als Conj. dass, so dass, auf<BR>dass, damit, was das betrifft dass,<BR>weshalb, wann, als, wenn, weil, da.<BR>यदपि wenn auch, obgleich;<BR> यद्वा oder,<BR>jedoch, indessen.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदर्थ
यदर्थ welchen (rel.) Zweck habend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदर्थम्
यदर्थम् u. ˚र्थे adv. weshalb, weswegen<BR>(rel.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदा
यदा॑ Conj. wann, als, wenn. Oft verst.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">Page347-1</a>]<BR>durch एव (यदैव). Im Nachs. bes. आत्,<BR>अथ, तद्, तदा, तेन u. s. w. यदा॑ कदा॑<BR>च so oft als;<BR> यदा कदा चिद् jederzeit.<BR>Die Verb. mit तदा s. d.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=346-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदि
1. य॑दि (य॑दी) Conj. wenn (im Nachs. oft)<BR>अथ, तद्, तदा, तसस्, तर्हि (u. s. w);<BR> so<BR>wahr als (im Nachs. तद्, तथा, तेन);<BR>ob (in der Doppelfr. meist beide male o.)<BR>einmal mit वा, यदि— न वा ob—der<BR>nicht);<BR> dass (nach Neg.);<BR> vielleicht dass,<BR>wie wenn? In der Bed. wenn oft verst.<BR>durch चिद्, चेद्, इद्, (य॑दी॑द्), उ (य॑द्यु).<BR>यद्यपि o. अपि यदि — (तथापि) o. तदपि<BR>obgleich, wenn auch — (so doch).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदि
2. यदि (Lob.) bei yad, wo yad steht (g.).<BR>यदीय wem (rel.) gehörig.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदु|यदुः
य॑दु m. N. eines alten Helden u. seines<BR>Stammes (sp. stets Pl.). Vgl. तुर्वश.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यदृच्छ
यदृच्छ zufällig;<BR> f. आ Zufall, meist ˚— u.<BR>Instr. adv. zufällig, von ungefähr, unerwartet.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्भविष्य
यद्भविष्य m. N. eines Fisches in der Fabel<BR>(Komme was kommen mag.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्रियञ्च्
यद्रि॑यञ्च् u. यद्यृञ्च् nach welcher (rel.)<BR>Richtung gewandt.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्वत्
यद्वत् Adv. wie (vgl. तद्वत्).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

