यद्वा s. यद्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्विध
यद्विध wie beschaffen (rel.).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यद्वृत्त
यद्वृत्त n. Begebenheit, Abenteuer.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्त्|यत्
यन्त् s. 2. इ.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=347-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

यन्तर्|यंतर्
