रुवण्यु
रुवण्यु॑ kreischend o. rauschend.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुवथ|रुवथः
रुव॑थ m. Gebrüll.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=366-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रुशत्पशु
