रूपय्
रूपय्, ˚यति gestalten, verkörpern, darstellen<BR>(d.). p. p. रूपित dargestellt.<BR>[<a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=368-1" target="_blank">Page368-1</a>]<BR>नि veranschaulichen, darstellen (d.),<BR>erblick, beobachten, untersuchen, er-<BR>wägen, festsetzen, erwählen zu (2 Acc.),<BR>bestimmen zu (Loc., Dat. o. Inf.)<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=367-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

रूपवन्त्|रूपवत्
