स्मार
स्मार m. Erinnerung, Sehnsucht.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मारण|स्मारणं
स्मारण n. das Erinnern.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्मारिन्
स्मारिन् sich erinnernd an (—˚).<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=519-2" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

