स्यूत s. सीव्.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

स्यूमन्
स्यू॑मन् n. Band, Riemen, Kette,Reihe.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

