स्योन|स्योनः
स्योन॑ sanft, zart, angenehm;<BR> n. weiches<BR>Lager.<BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslp?dict=CCS&page=520-1" target="_blank">PDF</a><BR><a href="https://dub.sh/cslc?dict=ccs" target="_blank">Correction</a>

